COMPILATION OF: E524C

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E524C

   1 a 0000 E524C: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-19 probe C (PLAN control):    */
   3 a 0006    /* no carets, no DEC arithmetic - plain    */
   4 a 0006    /* put skip(2) LIST literals only; pins    */
   5 a 0006    /* that skip counts and plain cells alone   */
   6 a 0006    /* are already byte-exact (H-A falsifier). */
   7 c 0006    dcl output file;
   8 c 0006    dcl a fixed binary;
   9 c 0006    a = 7;
  10 c 000C    put skip(2) list('plain one');
  11 c 0028    put list('plain two');
  12 c 003F    put skip(2) list(a);
  13 a 005B end E524C;

CODE SIZE = 005E
DATA AREA = 0014
FREE SYMS = 386A
END  COMPILATION
